WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

01:54.052 --> 01:55.719
Doc, hurry!

01:59.140 --> 02:01.642
Dr. Black Jack! We've been waiting for you.

02:01.643 --> 02:02.851
I'm Makino from internal medicine.

02:02.852 --> 02:04.269
What's his condition?

02:04.270 --> 02:05.604
Critical.

02:06.690 --> 02:08.232
Pinoco, wait here.

02:09.192 --> 02:12.653
<i>He's always so busy...</i>

02:15.073 --> 02:16.115
What's his condition?

02:16.116 --> 02:18.784
He had an operation for peritonitis when he was two.

02:19.703 --> 02:22.121
It must be ileus.

02:22.122 --> 02:23.205
We must hurry.

02:23.498 --> 02:25.457
Prepare the anesthesia.

02:34.968 --> 02:37.094
Wait! We hadn't heard you were coming!

02:37.564 --> 02:41.015
All of our doctors are busy at the moment, so we don't
have the resources to deal with any emergencies.

02:42.559 --> 02:45.269
Hospitals are always like that.

02:55.530 --> 02:56.363
Freeze!

02:57.157 --> 02:59.533
We're taking over this hospital!

02:59.868 --> 03:02.465
Everyone put your hands up and slowly
move towards the center of the room!

03:03.997 --> 03:06.081
Ohmigewdness!

03:07.923 --> 03:11.045
Originally "Hospital Jack” by Tezuka Osamu.

03:07.923 --> 03:11.045
Hospital Jack

03:12.255 --> 03:12.963
What was that?

03:14.132 --> 03:15.007
I'll go check.

03:17.260 --> 03:19.555
We've taken over this hospital!

03:19.763 --> 03:22.056
All of you! Put your hands up high
and get out of this room!

03:25.685 --> 03:26.727
Hurry up!

03:27.593 --> 03:28.395
I refuse.

03:28.897 --> 03:30.064
What?!

03:30.357 --> 03:32.733
This patient will die if we don't finish the operation.

03:33.526 --> 03:35.611
We can't stop now.

03:40.992 --> 03:42.660
What's taking so long?

03:43.620 --> 03:45.432
They won't stop this operation.

03:45.789 --> 03:46.870
What?!

03:47.165 --> 03:49.041
Are you the surgeon?

03:49.593 --> 03:50.433
Yes.

03:50.919 --> 03:53.629
Do you realize what we're doing here?

03:53.630 --> 03:55.130
You're our hostages.

03:55.131 --> 03:58.684
If you don't do exactly what we say,
we'll kill that patient right now!

04:00.470 --> 04:02.513
So leave the room now.

04:14.109 --> 04:15.467
Stay here and keep an eye on them.

04:15.694 --> 04:18.737
Tie the doctors up and lock the room you put them in.

04:18.772 --> 04:20.432
Supply Room

04:26.705 --> 04:28.169
What's this for?!

04:28.957 --> 04:31.083
Is it odd that a surgeon might have a scalpel on him?

04:31.084 --> 04:32.292
Watch your mouth!

04:36.991 --> 04:38.549
Don't be getting any crazy ideas.

04:42.595 --> 04:45.264
<i>I wonder if Doc is OK...</i>

04:46.150 --> 04:47.034
Is this the police?

04:47.058 --> 04:48.684
I'm calling from the Kinman Hospital.

04:48.685 --> 04:50.519
Listen carefully.

04:50.520 --> 04:52.491
We've taken over this hospital.

04:52.814 --> 04:55.305
Everyone in this hospital is our hostage.

04:55.525 --> 05:00.487
We demand you deliver a ransom of ¥1,000,000,000.

05:01.614 --> 05:03.782
And two vans for us to escape in.

05:04.595 --> 05:10.164
If you try to rescue them by force,
we'll blow up the generator room.

05:05.667 --> 05:07.100
Sign: Police

05:10.633 --> 05:13.292
Of course, that means the power will be cut off.

05:13.793 --> 05:15.419
Cut off the power?!

05:15.420 --> 05:16.587
How dare you!

05:16.588 --> 05:21.884
If they do that, all patients on life support will die!

05:26.473 --> 05:27.723
Those are dangerous chemicals!

05:34.648 --> 05:36.899
Dr. Black Jack! What are you doing?!

05:38.401 --> 05:39.360
What is that?

05:39.361 --> 05:41.147
I'm going to burn the rope with acid.

05:42.864 --> 05:44.455
But if that gets on your arm...

05:49.829 --> 05:50.954
Doctor!

06:01.591 --> 06:02.966
Is your arm OK?

06:03.022 --> 06:03.415
Yes.

06:04.428 --> 06:05.288
Thank goodness.

06:05.568 --> 06:08.055
Let's escape from the mortician's entrance.

06:08.348 --> 06:11.058
I'm sure they won't think of anyone leaving from there.

06:11.726 --> 06:14.103
Let's escape, Dr. Black Jack!

06:15.814 --> 06:17.045
Dr. Black Jack?

06:19.025 --> 06:21.235
I'm going to head back to the operating room.

06:22.028 --> 06:23.696
There's a patient who needs an operation.

06:25.054 --> 06:26.268
That's crazy!

06:26.658 --> 06:28.524
We won't be safe if they find us.

06:28.785 --> 06:29.868
I'm leaving!

06:29.869 --> 06:31.285
I don't want to die either!

06:33.963 --> 06:35.150
I'm ashamed.

06:36.251 --> 06:37.864
I forgot about the patient.

06:38.211 --> 06:39.582
I'll help you!

06:40.380 --> 06:42.214
I'm only an intern, but...

06:43.135 --> 06:44.096
I don't mind.

06:44.134 --> 06:45.608
I can use all the help I can get.

06:47.053 --> 06:48.804
I'll stay too.

07:17.751 --> 07:19.752
No problems on the second floor.

07:29.220 --> 07:30.760
He's in shock!

07:31.097 --> 07:32.222
Run a vitals check.

07:32.766 --> 07:34.391
Makino-san, prepare for the operation.

07:35.018 --> 07:36.552
You can assist me.

07:41.733 --> 07:43.400
His pulse is rising!

07:43.401 --> 07:44.777
<i>We have no time to waste.</i>

07:45.576 --> 07:46.868
<i>Let's start the abdominal section now!</i>

07:46.898 --> 07:53.238
Hospital Takeover
in Broad Daylight!

07:46.991 --> 07:49.184
This is live from Kinman Hospital.

07:49.331 --> 07:52.804
This hospital has been taken over.
The situation is very serious.

07:55.497 --> 07:59.166
<i>I need to call Sharaku somehow
and ask him to come help.</i>

08:00.498 --> 08:01.051
Boss.

08:01.399 --> 08:02.086
What?

08:02.754 --> 08:04.338
Masa isn't responding.

08:05.465 --> 08:06.507
Go check on him.

08:10.553 --> 08:11.679
God damn it...

08:15.100 --> 08:16.767
Hey! Snap out of it!

08:16.768 --> 08:18.331
Where'd they go?!

08:19.020 --> 08:19.770
What?!

08:19.771 --> 08:21.279
The doctors disappeared?!

08:22.816 --> 08:24.128
There's necrosis.

08:24.734 --> 08:26.250
We'll remove a segment of his intestines.

08:26.663 --> 08:27.270
Clamp.

08:29.155 --> 08:29.905
Clamp!

08:29.906 --> 08:30.916
I'm sorry!

08:31.367 --> 08:32.408
Stay calm!

08:35.180 --> 08:37.086
What's this about?!

08:49.486 --> 08:51.403
Where are the other doctors?

08:52.030 --> 08:54.279
They're no longer in this hospital.

08:57.869 --> 09:00.525
You think you can get away with this?

09:00.830 --> 09:03.957
You don't work at this hospital!

09:04.921 --> 09:07.583
Dr. Black Jack is assisting us with this operation!

09:08.296 --> 09:09.706
Black Jack?

09:10.090 --> 09:11.882
l've heard that name.

09:12.300 --> 09:16.090
You charge your patients crazy sums of money, right?

09:16.429 --> 09:19.972
I hate doctors like you!

09:23.645 --> 09:26.898
Boss, now's not the time to be messing around with them.

09:27.190 --> 09:28.649
We'd better hurry back to the lobby!

09:31.854 --> 09:34.363
Ken, I have a good idea.

09:34.364 --> 09:38.371
Hey, Black Jack, how long will this patient last?

09:39.035 --> 09:43.747
In his current state, sepsis will occur,
and he'll die within the hour.

09:46.732 --> 09:47.512
Is this the police?

09:47.599 --> 09:48.200
It's me.

09:48.461 --> 09:53.424
The doctors pissed me off by starting
an operation on a kid.

09:53.655 --> 09:55.843
Hey, Boss! What are you doing?!

09:56.475 --> 09:58.887
I made him stop the operation.

09:58.888 --> 10:01.223
The patient's still open.

10:01.808 --> 10:05.102
The doctor said he'll die within
the hour if he's left like that.

10:09.941 --> 10:12.609
<i>I think l've seen him before.</i>

10:13.820 --> 10:16.655
I'll let him continue once you give us the money.

10:16.656 --> 10:21.076
If you don't, neither the surgeons nor the
boy will be walking out of the hospital.

10:32.422 --> 10:36.008
Remember, if you get any funny ideas,

10:38.762 --> 10:42.816
we'll blow up the generator room, which will
result in the deaths of those on life-support.

10:43.349 --> 10:44.391
Got that?!

10:45.894 --> 10:47.276
Now you see.

10:47.645 --> 10:50.478
Boss! Why'd you have to do that?!

10:50.774 --> 10:52.399
All we want is money!

10:52.400 --> 10:55.569
We don't have to piss off the police any further!

10:55.597 --> 10:56.309
Shut up!

10:57.447 --> 10:58.865
I'll stay here.

10:59.115 --> 11:01.624
You go down to the basement and watch the exits.

11:01.868 --> 11:03.827
But that'll leave Gori alone in the lobby!

11:06.456 --> 11:09.249
Is someone talking about me?

11:09.751 --> 11:11.370
Quit your bitching!

11:11.711 --> 11:12.711
Go!

11:15.663 --> 11:20.623
Hospital Takeover
in Broad Daylight!

11:16.023 --> 11:17.810
It's now 2:20 PM.

11:18.356 --> 11:20.149
According to the latest information we've received,

11:20.203 --> 11:22.970
the situation has gotten much worse.

11:23.156 --> 11:28.487
The terrorists are now threatening to start killing patients
if they do not receive the money within the hour.

11:28.511 --> 11:29.701
Doc...

11:33.516 --> 11:34.474
I need to pee.

11:36.394 --> 11:38.371
I need to go pee!

11:38.604 --> 11:39.855
Hold it!

11:43.609 --> 11:46.840
I can't hold it anymore!

11:51.409 --> 11:53.015
Shush up! Stop crying!

11:55.124 --> 11:56.747
Go now!

11:57.957 --> 11:59.916
Ohmigewdness...

12:05.506 --> 12:07.758
Sharaku, answer the phone!

12:09.950 --> 12:12.721
Pogo, don't...

12:12.722 --> 12:16.224
Dang Sharaku... Answer now!

12:17.101 --> 12:18.393
Who is this?

12:18.403 --> 12:19.204
Sharaku?

12:19.228 --> 12:22.273
We have a problem at the hospital!

12:20.438 --> 12:23.940
I have no business with a beauty shop.

12:22.786 --> 12:24.459
Sharaku!

12:25.902 --> 12:27.652
I am bald.

12:27.653 --> 12:30.822
Sharaku, you dummy!

12:34.077 --> 12:36.881
A kid's calling from inside?

12:37.055 --> 12:37.595
Patch me through!

12:39.108 --> 12:40.235
Help me.

12:40.291 --> 12:41.666
Are you OK, little lady?

12:41.667 --> 12:43.460
I'm not a kid!

12:43.535 --> 12:44.961
I'm a grown-up!

12:54.222 --> 12:56.557
Please let us continue the operation!

12:56.849 --> 12:57.766
Yeah!

12:57.767 --> 12:58.975
The kid's dying!

12:59.727 --> 13:01.228
Shut your trap!

13:04.441 --> 13:07.028
Masa? How are things there?

13:06.275 --> 13:08.364
Doctor, what should we do?

13:08.709 --> 13:09.429
Good.

13:08.826 --> 13:10.159
If we don't do anything...

13:11.586 --> 13:12.572
Doctor?!

13:11.669 --> 13:13.622
I'm waiting for their reply now.

13:14.145 --> 13:15.677
Kinman Hospital Takeover Taskforce

13:15.701 --> 13:19.121
Yes. This is the headquarters of the Kinman
Hospital Takeover Taskforce.

13:19.122 --> 13:22.082
Please save my son!

13:22.083 --> 13:23.667
Please!

13:26.295 --> 13:28.130
We can't get that kind of money ready by then.

13:29.173 --> 13:30.571
There's just not enough time.

13:30.883 --> 13:33.477
In order to save the patient and the
doctors in the operating room...

13:35.430 --> 13:36.751
We'll have to force our way in!

13:37.014 --> 13:39.891
According to that call earlier, there's
only one man in the lobby.

13:39.892 --> 13:41.161
We should be able to do it!

13:41.686 --> 13:43.026
How many patients are on life-support?

13:43.604 --> 13:45.644
According to the doctors that escaped, five.

13:45.898 --> 13:48.817
I'll put a few ambulances equipped
with life-support on standby.

13:49.318 --> 13:50.277
All right,

13:50.278 --> 13:54.340
Once we're ready to enter, tell
him we have his money ready!

13:54.615 --> 13:55.782
We'll force our way in!

13:56.451 --> 13:58.243
Twenty more minutes.

13:58.745 --> 14:02.706
Do you really think you can get away with this?

14:02.974 --> 14:04.227
Yeah!

14:04.500 --> 14:07.210
Letting this Kid die would be an even worse crime!

14:07.322 --> 14:08.291
Shut up!

14:08.629 --> 14:10.046
Stop your jabbering!

14:10.590 --> 14:13.572
But you sure got quiet.

14:14.552 --> 14:16.094
Are you scared?

14:18.181 --> 14:22.142
Eh, Dr. Black Jack?

14:24.687 --> 14:25.565
Yeah.

14:25.813 --> 14:27.478
The money's ready?

14:29.567 --> 14:31.317
Don't look so relieved.

14:31.611 --> 14:34.696
You're going to wait until I have the money in my hands.

14:35.448 --> 14:37.079
That'll be too late.

14:37.366 --> 14:39.576
Doctor, please say something!

14:39.577 --> 14:41.161
Have you given up?

14:41.162 --> 14:42.505
What happened to you?!

14:44.922 --> 14:48.736
He's too worried about saving his own
skin to care about the patient.

14:49.962 --> 14:52.027
Yeah. They agreed to our demands.

14:52.465 --> 14:53.685
Don't relax yet.

14:53.841 --> 14:55.842
Make Sam wait in the generator room.

14:55.843 --> 14:57.385
Tell him to hold off until I give the order.,

14:57.386 --> 14:58.637
Ken, come here.

15:12.527 --> 15:15.487
Ken, go down to the lobby and accept the money.

15:17.407 --> 15:20.700
I'll join you once I deal with things here.

15:20.701 --> 15:22.772
Boss! I can't!

15:23.162 --> 15:24.871
You should do it!

15:25.623 --> 15:28.057
Can't you follow my order?!

15:29.001 --> 15:31.001
Just why are you so obsessed with doctors?!

15:31.254 --> 15:33.187
Wasn't the money what you wanted?!

15:33.548 --> 15:36.670
It's as if you hate doctors, and this is your revenge!

15:37.051 --> 15:39.219
That's none of your business!

15:39.830 --> 15:41.054
Revenge?

15:42.181 --> 15:43.390
I remember!

15:43.391 --> 15:45.142
You're the man from that...

15:46.602 --> 15:47.642
Please do something.

15:50.356 --> 15:51.773
Please save him!

15:52.442 --> 15:54.734
I'll pay you anything, even if it takes my whole life!

15:55.486 --> 15:56.574
I can't.

15:57.155 --> 16:00.699
There's nothing more I can do.

16:05.621 --> 16:06.663
I'll never forgive you!

16:07.582 --> 16:10.717
I'll bear a grudge against your kind forever if he dies!

16:14.088 --> 16:15.172
That's right.

16:15.173 --> 16:18.300
The doctors of this hospital turned their backs on my son.

16:18.301 --> 16:19.551
That's why...

16:19.552 --> 16:21.052
We did everything we could!

16:21.053 --> 16:22.971
We just couldn't save him!

16:23.723 --> 16:24.663
Shut up!

16:25.016 --> 16:29.772
You never thought he had a chance from the
start, so you didn't even bother to try!

16:45.995 --> 16:46.870
B-Boss!

16:47.622 --> 16:48.802
What?!

16:49.248 --> 16:50.499
The SWAT team?!

16:50.506 --> 16:51.234
What?!

16:51.876 --> 16:52.918
Listen, Gori!

16:52.919 --> 16:54.306
Take some kids as hostages!

16:54.504 --> 16:57.005
OK... Some kids?

16:58.800 --> 17:00.717
Ohmigewdness!

17:00.760 --> 17:02.844
Wait!

17:03.221 --> 17:04.467
Huh!

17:06.057 --> 17:07.390
Come on!

17:09.894 --> 17:11.228
Yeah!

17:15.316 --> 17:17.317
Officers!

17:23.991 --> 17:26.201
I'm sorry!

17:26.202 --> 17:27.798
Gori! Come in!

17:29.705 --> 17:30.622
Damn it!

17:30.623 --> 17:32.493
Sam! Cut off the power!

17:36.087 --> 17:38.696
We'll escape by using the doctors as hostages!

17:39.549 --> 17:41.341
I've had enough of you!

17:41.723 --> 17:42.319
What?!

17:42.343 --> 17:44.511
You used us!

17:44.512 --> 17:46.288
You told us this was for the money,

17:46.556 --> 17:48.807
but it was all for your stupid revenge!

17:48.935 --> 17:50.892
Damn you!

17:53.396 --> 17:54.563
Dammit!

18:06.784 --> 18:09.244
Dr. Black Jack! Hurry with the operation!

18:11.743 --> 18:13.210
There goes the power.

18:13.603 --> 18:14.883
They must have destroyed the generator room.

18:15.089 --> 18:16.569
Arayama-kun, what about the door?

18:17.589 --> 18:18.709
It won't open!

18:20.018 --> 18:22.582
The automatic doors must be jammed
shut because of the blackout!

18:22.876 --> 18:25.103
Does anyone have a lighter?!

18:28.976 --> 18:30.849
If the police get here and open the door...

18:30.929 --> 18:32.796
We don't have time for that!

18:34.742 --> 18:36.462
How could you do this to us?!

18:37.022 --> 18:39.002
Now we can't perform the operation!

18:39.176 --> 18:42.912
Why did it have to end up like this?

18:46.954 --> 18:48.694
No. We'll continue the operation.

18:49.927 --> 18:52.627
But, in the dark?!

18:53.477 --> 18:55.897
Hand me the instruments by feeling them.

18:57.585 --> 18:59.772
You can't perform an operation blind!

19:00.749 --> 19:01.479
Clamp.

19:02.275 --> 19:03.385
You can find it by feeling it, right?

19:06.992 --> 19:07.785
This is impossible!

19:07.939 --> 19:09.592
He'll bleed to death from even one mistake!

19:09.959 --> 19:11.959
I anticipated this would happen,

19:12.018 --> 19:14.499
so I stared at him and memorized where everything was.

19:15.264 --> 19:17.246
So I could operate on him even in total darkness.

19:17.292 --> 19:18.379
But...

19:23.527 --> 19:25.207
Doctor, here's the clamp.

19:26.460 --> 19:28.527
Take the patient's pulse by hand.

19:29.127 --> 19:29.683
OK.

19:45.612 --> 19:46.359
Why?!

19:46.712 --> 19:48.512
Why would you go that far?!

19:50.718 --> 19:52.187
Because I'm a doctor.

19:56.794 --> 19:57.587
How's his pulse?

19:57.680 --> 19:58.361
It's fine.

19:58.647 --> 19:59.094
Gauze.

19:59.341 --> 19:59.828
Here.

20:02.864 --> 20:03.677
I did it.

20:05.820 --> 20:06.899
The power's back...

20:07.321 --> 20:08.269
Yes!

20:08.740 --> 20:09.590
How's the patient?

20:11.117 --> 20:13.359
I don't think I made any mistakes,
but please double-check.

20:14.537 --> 20:16.280
This is a miracle.

20:16.748 --> 20:17.890
It's perfect!

20:19.459 --> 20:21.084
Someone please take care of the sutures.

20:22.519 --> 20:22.959
I'll do it!

20:26.614 --> 20:29.551
Doctor, is that from when you burned through the rope?

20:31.512 --> 20:32.637
I'll get some ointment!

20:32.638 --> 20:33.643
Don't worry about it.

20:36.768 --> 20:38.566
Suturing complete.

20:39.562 --> 20:41.521
Thank you for your help.

20:47.737 --> 20:49.992
Is the kid safe?

20:51.312 --> 20:51.912
Yes.

20:54.494 --> 20:55.494
I see.

20:56.120 --> 20:56.953
Kenta!

20:57.455 --> 20:58.789
Kenta!

20:59.457 --> 21:01.374
Doctor, how's Kenta?

21:01.709 --> 21:03.376
He's fine now.

21:04.629 --> 21:05.462
Kenta!

21:05.463 --> 21:06.463
Thank goodness!

21:06.464 --> 21:10.258
I'm so glad you're OK.

21:12.136 --> 21:13.804
Were you the one who performed the operation?

21:14.722 --> 21:16.181
No, I couldn't have.

21:29.237 --> 21:30.320
Doc!

21:35.576 --> 21:38.078
I was so scared!

21:41.249 --> 21:42.309
How are the patients?

21:43.042 --> 21:44.835
They're all safe.

21:53.970 --> 21:58.159
I wish I could have met you sooner.

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
Only look straight at me.

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.917 --> 22:57.300
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.917 --> 22:53.122
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.577 --> 22:57.301
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.045 --> 23:43.930
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.045 --> 23:36.978
sora no hate tooku

23:37.071 --> 23:43.871
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.060 --> 24:15.042
The House on the Cape is Incomplete

23:45.173 --> 23:47.326
Doctor, which would you choose?

23:47.366 --> 23:50.566
Choosing to live but not being able
to do what you want to do most...

23:50.566 --> 23:53.985
or finishing a masterpiece even if it costs
you your own life?

23:54.373 --> 23:55.020
Why?!

23:55.173 --> 23:56.633
No means no!

23:56.713 --> 23:59.576
Please let me finish this!

24:01.675 --> 24:02.564
Are you kidding me?!

24:02.589 --> 24:04.357
Are you blind? Be more careful!

24:04.371 --> 24:05.927
I can't let a sick man build a house.

24:06.107 --> 24:08.147
There are still things I need to do.

24:08.253 --> 24:11.226
I would like to keep living and
continue making masterpieces.

24:11.657 --> 24:14.664
Next Karte - The House on the Cape is Incomplete.

24:16.128 --> 24:17.837
Karte NG...

24:21.341 --> 24:23.342
Oh, it's only water...
